    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75944" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐρᾰνο-μήκης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>high as heaven, shooting up
				to heaven, exceeding high</i> or <i>tall</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλάτη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					5.239
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δένδρεα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.138
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στήλη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					14
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαμπάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					92
				</span></i>
			 (anap.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄθω οὐρανομήκη</span>
			(voc.) Xerxis Epist. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.455d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ. φωνή, κλέος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				357
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				459
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1408b13
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ. ποιεῖν τι</span> to exalt it
				<i>to the skies</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				15.134
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ. σημεῖα τῆς εὐνοίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					183
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαφορά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					2.272
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλπίδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eun.
					<u>Hist.</u>
					p.251
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i></div>
